# prettier (.prettierrc) formats the JavaScript of this repository and nothing else:
#   npx prettier@3.3.3 --write "tests/*.mjs" docs/shots.mjs
# Everything is ignored here but those files, so that "prettier --write ." cannot touch the test scenes (tests/*.json
# are compared byte for byte), the documents or Unity's files.
/*
!/tests/
/tests/*
!/tests/*.mjs
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/shots.mjs
